Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hill Giant (summoning sick) and have Lightning Greaves (equipped creature has haste and shroud; equip {0}) and Giant Growth in hand with {G}{C}{C} floating. The opponent is at 6 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
